  "fullDescription": "The Study Planner Template will help you with exams, assignments, classes, and more! Use these Canva Templates to create a Study Tracker, Study Checklist, and other Study Essentials. This complete Study Kit is 100% editable! Make your own Study Planner Printable with this Canva Planner! It comes in a bright design, but you can change everything in these templates from fonts, colors, elements, shapes, layouts, and more! All you need is a free Canva account!\n\nWhat is included:\n\n• 48 templates to edit in Canva\n\n• Design: Bright\n\n• Size: A4 + US letter\n\nThe templates include the following:\n\n• Daily planner\n\n• Weekly overview\n\n• Goals overview\n\n• 7-step goal planner\n\n• Annual overview\n\n• Year at a glance\n\n• Weekly schedule (with and without times)\n\n• Weekly study plan\n\n• Revision worksheet\n\n• Daily study planner\n\n• Weekly study planner\n\n• Study plan\n\n• Exam prep sheet\n\n• Examination timeline\n\n• Terminology sheet\n\n• Formulae sheet\n\n• Translations sheet\n\n• Chapter summary\n\n• Study challenge\n\n• Topic study methods\n\n• Topic analyzer\n\n• Student budget overview\n\n• Student budget worksheet\n\n• Student budget breakdown\n\n• Textbook list sheet\n\n• Assignments overview\n\n• Assignments worksheet\n\n• Group assignment sheet\n\n• Pomodoro worksheet\n\n• Pomodoro timed worksheet\n\n• 10 minute tasks\n\n• 20 minute tasks\n\n• 1 hour tasks\n\n• Meal planner\n\n• Notes sheets x 4 different layouts\n\n• To do list\n\n• Important dates (3 months per sheet)\n\n• Blank calendar – Portrait layout (5/6 weeks)\n\n• Blank calendar – Landscape layout (5/6 weeks)\n\nHow does it work?\n\n1. After purchasing you will be able to download the PDFs (one will contain the link to the template/s, and the other one is the Help Guide)\n\n2. Open the link in the PDF to go to Canva.com, where you can start editing right away 🙂\n\n3. See the Help Guide PDF in case you’re new to Canva — I have added some easy steps with images!",
